{"t":"Ghoul Room Quest","s":"ghoul-room-quest-5b16d","k":"quest","i":"assets/wiki/Route_Mintwallin_1_345830.png","q":1,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Ghoul Room Quest</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"aka\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Aliases</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">None.</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"log\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Quest Log</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Requirements</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"premium\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Premium</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"lvl\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Level</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">0<br/>(20 recommended)</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"new\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvVXBkYXRlcy81LjAxP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\" title=\"Updates/5.01 (page does not exist)\">5.01</span><br/><span class=\"implementation-date\"></span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Active</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Quests</nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-quest-legend\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Legend\">Legend</span></h3>\n<p class=\"no-results\">This quest has no legend.</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Thais\">Thais</a> <a href=\"#/wiki/Ancient%20Temple\">Ancient Temple</a>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-dangers\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dangers\">Dangers</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Spider\">Spiders</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Rotworm\">Rotworms</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Orc\">Orcs</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Orc%20Spearman\">Orc Spearmen</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Orc%20Warrior\">Orc Warriors</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Minotaur\">Minotaurs</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Skeleton\">Skeletons</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Ghoul\">Ghouls</a>, maybe lured <a href=\"#/wiki/Fire%20Devil\">Fire Devil</a>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-reward\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Reward\">Reward</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Garlic%20Necklace\">Garlic Necklace</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Club%20Ring\">Club Ring</a>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-spoiler\">\n<div class=\"tw-cmd showhide-visible showhide-init quest-spoiler\" data-command=\"showhide-content\" data-showhide-value=\"visible\">\n<div class=\"showhide-header\" data-showhide-element=\"header\">Click to show/hide the quest spoiler.<br/><span style=\"font-size: 0.8em;\">(settings)</span></div>\n<div class=\"showhide-body\" data-showhide-element=\"body\">\n<div class=\"spoiler-pretext\">Spoiler • edit</div>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Required_Equipment\">Required Equipment</span></h3>\n<ul><li>Recommended <a href=\"#/wiki/Destroy%20Field\">Destroy Field</a> or using <a href=\"#/wiki/Cure%20Poison\">Antidote</a> for <a href=\"#/wiki/Poison%20Field\">Poison Fields</a></li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Method\">Method</span></h3>\n<ul><li>Go to <a href=\"#/wiki/Thais\">Thais</a> <a href=\"#/wiki/Ancient%20Temple\">Ancient Temple</a></li>\n<li>Down 2 levels and head North - all the way to the northern end of the large room</li>\n<li>Go down to the <a href=\"#/wiki/Rotworm\">Rotworms</a>, and follow this path to the east, south, and east, and go down the ladder. Watch out for <a href=\"#/wiki/Orc\">Orcs</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Orc%20Spearman\">Orc Spearmen</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Orc%20Warrior\">Orc Warriors</a> and possible lured <a href=\"#/wiki/Fire%20Devil\">Fire Devil</a>:</li></ul>\n<p><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Route Mintwallin 1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"266\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Route_Mintwallin_1_345830.png\" width=\"450\"/></span>\n</p>\n<ul><li>This room will be filled with <a href=\"#/wiki/Poison%20Field\">Poison Fields</a>. You can either run for it or use <a href=\"#/wiki/Destroy%20Field\">Destroy Field</a> to get through.</li>\n<li>Once through the poison fields, go down the ladder</li>\n<li>Follow a small tunnel to the east and then north:</li></ul>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Ghoul Room Quest 2\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"283\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Ghoul_Room_Quest_2_22a422.png\" width=\"182\"/></span>\n</p>\n<ul><li>After you come to a room with <a href=\"#/wiki/Skeleton\">Skeletons</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Rotworm\">Rotworms</a>, \"Open\" a dead skeleton in the South-East of the room - you will get <a href=\"#/wiki/Key%203600\">Key 3600</a></li>\n<li>When you have the key, \"Use\" the well in that room to go down it.</li>\n<li>Kill 3 <a href=\"#/wiki/Ghoul\">Ghouls</a>, unlock the door with <a href=\"#/wiki/Key%203600\">Key 3600</a>, get your reward.</li></ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>","quests":["kingdom-of-kormarak-quest"]}